## Installation

<InstallCommand pnpm="pnpm add @shardsui/svelte" shadcnSvelte="pnpm dlx shadcn-svelte@latest add https://coss-sv.vercel.app/r/separator.json" />

## Usage

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
  import { Separator } from "@coss-sv/ui/components/ui/separator";
</script>

<Separator />
```

## API Reference

### Separator

An accessible dividing line. It renders horizontally by default, exposes its orientation to
assistive technology, forwards native attributes, and keeps the COSS muted border color.

See the [Shards Separator API](https://shardsui.com/svelte/separator) for element and orientation
props.
